                "C": "Implantation",
                "D": "Lactation"
            },
            "answer": "A"
             
        },
        {
            "id": "FT-021",
            "question": "The arterial supply of the fallopian tube comes from the",
            "options": {
                "A": "Uterine and ovarian arteries",
