                "C": "Axillary glands",
                "D": "Inguinal glands only"
            },
            "answer": "B"
             
        },
        {
            "id": "FT-023",
            "question": "The nerve supply of the fallopian tubes is from the",
            "options": {
                "A": "Pudendal plexus",
